WEBVTT

00:30.860 --> 00:33.590
It's time, O-chan.

00:37.230 --> 00:42.540
Hey who are you thinking of now?

00:42.540 --> 00:50.470
I am thinking of you

00:53.080 --> 00:55.750
I felt it when I opened my window

00:55.750 --> 00:58.020
Ah the smell of the night

00:58.020 --> 01:00.590
Whose face did I just see

01:00.590 --> 01:02.890
In my heart?

01:02.890 --> 01:05.660
When I was

01:05.660 --> 01:07.900
Soaked by the cold rain

01:07.900 --> 01:09.560
You were the only one

01:09.560 --> 01:12.530
To reach out your hand

01:12.530 --> 01:17.370
Why are you always

01:17.370 --> 01:21.980
The one to support me

01:21.980 --> 01:24.910
Each time

01:24.910 --> 01:29.220
I fall deeper in love

01:29.220 --> 01:34.420
Hey no matter what I do I want to see you

01:34.420 --> 01:39.130
Falling in love hurts

01:39.130 --> 01:41.900
You are always the only reason

01:41.900 --> 01:44.430
I feel happiness and heartache

01:44.430 --> 01:52.340
I am thinking of you

01:55.240 --> 02:03.850
Hey I want to see you

02:06.550 --> 02:08.250
Morning, Mitsuru!

02:08.790 --> 02:11.160
Good morning, Lady Tamaki.

02:11.160 --> 02:12.630
What's this?

02:12.130 --> 02:15.530
The

02:12.130 --> 02:15.530
Course

02:12.130 --> 02:15.530
of the

02:12.130 --> 02:15.530
Battle

02:13.160 --> 02:16.100
I heard that the decisive battle was today,

02:16.100 --> 02:20.500
so as a traditional bringer of victory and happiness,

02:20.500 --> 02:24.170
I prepared a meal of flattened abalone, dried chestnuts,

02:24.170 --> 02:26.880
raw abalone in salt water, steamed rice with chestnut,

02:26.880 --> 02:29.440
and stew made with seaweed and radishes.

02:29.440 --> 02:32.450
That's amazing! I've never heard of that tradition before.

02:32.450 --> 02:34.210
Thank you, Mitsuru.

02:35.050 --> 02:38.610
You really are great at cooking.

02:39.620 --> 02:43.150
By the way, Shinji said he cooked as a hobby, didn't he?

02:44.460 --> 02:48.120
We all shared what our hobbies were the other day.

02:48.400 --> 02:49.660
Is that so?

02:50.370 --> 02:54.070
Inukai has been a talented cook since he was little.

02:54.070 --> 02:55.770
Is that right?

02:55.770 --> 02:56.970
But...

02:56.970 --> 03:00.510
I might be the better cook now.

03:00.510 --> 03:03.170
I practiced it very seriously.

03:04.810 --> 03:07.480
And came up with all kinds of new recipes...

03:16.420 --> 03:17.860
I'm off!

03:21.230 --> 03:22.560
Hey, you.

03:24.430 --> 03:25.830
It's been a while.

03:25.830 --> 03:27.600
You look well.

03:34.410 --> 03:35.810
That's right.

03:35.810 --> 03:38.150
We haven't been introduced yet.

03:38.150 --> 03:39.780
Masataka Ashiya.

03:39.780 --> 03:43.350
I'm a judicial officer in charge of the temple investigation.

03:43.350 --> 03:46.220
I often work around here.

03:46.850 --> 03:51.190
I heard you've been looking after our Kiyono?

03:51.760 --> 03:53.130
Your?

03:53.130 --> 03:55.830
Could you be Kiyono's uncle?

03:55.830 --> 03:57.260
Correct!

03:57.900 --> 04:01.100
<i>I'm staying at my uncle's place.</i>

04:01.100 --> 04:03.540
<i>He's so useless.</i>

04:06.670 --> 04:07.570
Right here.

04:07.910 --> 04:09.900
The complexion of your visual space is bad.

04:10.650 --> 04:15.050
Ah, sorry. Physiognomy is a hobby of mine.

04:15.050 --> 04:18.710
You should watch out for misfortune today.

04:19.620 --> 04:20.520
What?

04:20.520 --> 04:21.820
Misfortune?

04:21.820 --> 04:24.090
My uncle said that?

04:24.360 --> 04:25.460
Yeah.

04:25.460 --> 04:27.000
I'm sorry, Tamaki.

04:27.000 --> 04:28.300
But don't worry.

04:28.300 --> 04:31.670
When it comes to inaccurate fortunes, he's peerless.

04:31.670 --> 04:34.640
I see. So maybe you should believe the opposite will happen.

04:34.640 --> 04:35.670
That's right.

04:35.670 --> 04:38.470
Being told a bad fortune is actually a good thing!

04:38.810 --> 04:41.210
I see. That's true.

04:43.780 --> 04:45.510
I'm jealous.

04:45.510 --> 04:49.110
Young girls can always turn an outcome to their favor.

04:50.250 --> 04:52.190
What are you saying, Kiyono?

04:52.190 --> 04:53.660
We're the same age.

04:53.660 --> 04:55.490
Oh, that's right!

04:58.990 --> 05:00.130
Whoa!

05:00.130 --> 05:01.700
Pork cutlets for lunch?

05:01.700 --> 05:05.270
Mitsuru said it was a bringer of victory.

05:05.270 --> 05:06.900
Victory!

05:06.900 --> 05:08.230
Victory for me, too!

05:09.040 --> 05:11.630
I'm thankful for Mitsuru's kindness.

05:12.210 --> 05:13.370
That's true.

05:15.540 --> 05:16.600
Delicious!

05:17.380 --> 05:18.210
Sure is!

05:20.150 --> 05:21.120
This is good.

05:20.880 --> 05:21.840
Yes!

05:23.620 --> 05:26.050
U-Um...

05:26.050 --> 05:28.320
I'm counting on you all today.

05:29.260 --> 05:30.780
What's this all of a sudden?

05:32.130 --> 05:36.300
Well, because I went and promised Aria on my own,

05:36.300 --> 05:39.830
Yuichi and Shinji have to deal with it...

05:39.830 --> 05:42.700
Please don't apologize.

05:43.000 --> 05:46.570
We only have to do what the
Tamayori princess decides.

05:46.570 --> 05:47.640
Don't worry about it.

05:47.640 --> 05:51.650
You always say that, but I'm embarrassed...

05:51.650 --> 05:55.220
that I can't do anything myself.

05:55.220 --> 05:56.450
Cut it out!

05:57.520 --> 06:00.520
Your best feature is your attitude.

06:00.520 --> 06:03.120
Smile and be positive.

06:03.120 --> 06:05.960
That way we can do our best.

06:06.560 --> 06:07.860
Mahiro...

06:07.860 --> 06:11.730
I'm in agreement with Mahiro.

06:11.730 --> 06:18.570
And I believe that you support us more than you realize.

06:18.570 --> 06:19.940
That's right!

06:19.940 --> 06:22.970
I look up to you.

06:24.080 --> 06:25.640
You guys...

06:33.350 --> 06:38.220
That's that blonde-haired, blue-eyed English teacher, right?

06:38.760 --> 06:40.060
What?

06:40.060 --> 06:43.260
It's only natural that a man's eyes would travel to a beautiful woman.

06:44.070 --> 06:45.600
Right, Takuma?

06:45.600 --> 06:48.570
I'd rather not be put on the same level as you.

06:48.570 --> 06:52.270
Lately, I can't help but pity you, Mahiro.

06:52.270 --> 06:53.510
What'd you say?!

06:53.510 --> 06:55.530
Shinji, what about you?

06:56.440 --> 06:57.810
Um...

07:18.930 --> 07:20.130
Did you see it?

07:20.130 --> 07:20.900
Yes.

07:20.900 --> 07:24.530
Recently, I've been able to see it a little.

07:25.310 --> 07:28.610
I can tell you're doing your best, Tamaki.

07:28.910 --> 07:30.340
We'll definitely win.

07:30.340 --> 07:32.350
There's nothing to worry about.

07:32.350 --> 07:34.180
We're here.

07:34.180 --> 07:35.950
There's no way we'd lose.

07:37.150 --> 07:38.120
Yes.

07:38.690 --> 07:40.050
Excuse me.

07:42.990 --> 07:46.950
Recently there have been sightings of strange people at night.

07:47.430 --> 07:51.390
So when it gets dark, try not to go outside too much, okay?

07:53.000 --> 07:54.570
I understand.

07:54.570 --> 07:55.830
I'll be careful.

07:59.010 --> 08:00.940
Ms. Fiona...

08:00.940 --> 08:02.410
is a good person, isn't she?

08:04.610 --> 08:12.020
I like that everyone at school is bright and fun and kind...

08:12.690 --> 08:16.360
If the Onikirimaru is released,

08:16.360 --> 08:18.790
the world might end, right?

08:20.260 --> 08:25.000
But I don't want everyone to be involved in something so frightening.

08:25.830 --> 08:29.400
So I know I have to do my best.

08:30.170 --> 08:32.070
I have to do it.

08:36.910 --> 08:37.840
Right.

08:42.680 --> 08:46.620
Please. Protect everyone.

08:47.890 --> 08:50.150
Then let us go.

08:51.190 --> 08:52.020
Yes.

08:52.760 --> 08:54.160
Lady Tamaki!

08:55.160 --> 08:56.360
Take these.

08:56.900 --> 08:58.030
What are they?

08:58.030 --> 09:01.400
Lady Baba said, just in case.

09:01.400 --> 09:04.700
These are talismans with years of spiritual power within them.

09:05.710 --> 09:08.340
We could only prepare three of them,

09:08.340 --> 09:10.240
but please take them with you.

09:10.240 --> 09:12.710
Is it all right to take something this precious?

09:13.080 --> 09:16.150
This is a battle to secure the safety of the seal.

09:16.150 --> 09:19.280
Lady Baba said to make use of them.

09:20.250 --> 09:22.220
Thank you, Mitsuru.

09:22.220 --> 09:24.030
It's very reassuring.

09:24.030 --> 09:27.430
Also, Lady Baba has some instructions.

09:27.430 --> 09:31.530
This time, Lady Tamaki is in charge.

09:31.530 --> 09:35.060
Everyone should follow this command faithfully.

09:36.240 --> 09:37.870
Tell us, Tamaki,

09:38.870 --> 09:42.500
how should we proceed in this battle?

09:52.750 --> 09:56.210
Let's all come home safe and eat dinner together!

10:05.100 --> 10:07.030
Of course that's my intention.

10:07.030 --> 10:08.900
All right. Let's go!

10:08.900 --> 10:09.840
Yeah!

10:09.600 --> 10:10.400
Yes.

10:10.400 --> 10:12.310
Then let us go.

10:36.400 --> 10:37.630
Are you all right?

10:37.630 --> 10:39.290
Y-Yes.

10:39.770 --> 10:42.140
Could you be scared?

10:42.140 --> 10:44.840
O-Of course not!

10:44.840 --> 10:46.140
Sounds like you're right on.

10:46.140 --> 10:47.070
Hey.

10:47.070 --> 10:48.630
Your nostrils are flared.

10:49.240 --> 10:51.610
Just kidding!

10:51.610 --> 10:52.580
C'mon...

10:53.450 --> 10:56.680
All you have to do is be ready.

10:57.490 --> 11:01.320
Just be your normal, worry-free self.

11:01.320 --> 11:03.150
We'll protect you.

11:04.030 --> 11:05.120
That's right.

11:07.830 --> 11:09.830
How can he sleep here?

11:09.830 --> 11:11.230
Wake up!

11:14.340 --> 11:17.170
Leave the fighting to us.

11:17.170 --> 11:20.110
Yes, I'm counting on you all.

11:23.680 --> 11:25.200
It's time.

11:36.960 --> 11:38.730
I'll ask just once.

11:38.730 --> 11:41.420
Do you insist on going against me?

11:41.900 --> 11:44.830
I cannot allow the Onikirimaru into the world.

11:45.400 --> 11:48.440
And I even gave you the chance to think about it.

11:48.440 --> 11:53.210
But if we talk about it, we may be able to come to an agreement.

11:53.210 --> 11:55.040
I dislike troublesome things.

11:55.040 --> 11:57.780
If you're in my way,
I'll just dispose of you.

11:57.780 --> 11:58.750
But-

12:02.580 --> 12:05.090
Enough. Now it's our turn.

12:05.090 --> 12:06.050
Get back!

12:10.930 --> 12:12.150
Here we go!

12:38.650 --> 12:40.020
Shit.

12:40.020 --> 12:42.750
That long-haired freak.

12:44.330 --> 12:46.830
Die, crow.

12:46.830 --> 12:49.890
Are you kidding me?

12:51.370 --> 12:53.460
Fly, death god!

12:57.440 --> 12:59.110
Surprised?!

12:59.110 --> 13:01.080
I've been watching you!

13:06.910 --> 13:07.850
What?!

13:18.260 --> 13:18.780
Shit.

13:19.460 --> 13:21.100
What kind of magic is this?

13:21.100 --> 13:22.190
You monster.

13:22.460 --> 13:24.730
Magic? No.

13:25.270 --> 13:27.100
That was just air pressure.

13:27.400 --> 13:29.560
Thanks for the explanation.

13:42.580 --> 13:43.610
Takuma!

13:55.960 --> 13:57.500
Burn them.

13:57.500 --> 13:58.690
Blaze!

14:08.540 --> 14:09.540
Accelerate! Accelerate!

14:09.540 --> 14:10.670
Fall, fall, fall!

14:14.150 --> 14:15.010
Shinji!

14:22.560 --> 14:24.650
Single emergence.

14:26.860 --> 14:28.330
Miss.

14:31.370 --> 14:34.820
You will be wounded by your own fangs.

15:02.260 --> 15:03.830
What's wrong?

15:03.830 --> 15:05.390
Are you at your limit already?

15:06.400 --> 15:08.100
Are you kidding?

15:09.240 --> 15:10.700
Are you kidding?!

15:18.110 --> 15:19.210
<i>What should I do?</i>

15:19.210 --> 15:20.580
<i>At this rate everyone will...</i>

15:26.250 --> 15:28.220
That's right. I have these.

15:30.090 --> 15:31.130
Let's see.

15:31.130 --> 15:33.960
The incantation Mitsuru taught me was...

15:33.960 --> 15:35.030
Byakuhou!

15:35.030 --> 15:36.060
Fukiteki!

15:36.060 --> 15:38.160
Bring swift justice!

15:51.980 --> 15:52.910
Byakuhou!

15:52.910 --> 15:53.850
Fukiteki!

15:53.850 --> 15:55.710
Bring swift justice!

16:03.290 --> 16:06.390
Byakuhou! Fukiteki! Bring swift justice!

16:29.280 --> 16:31.080
What are you doing, you idiot?!

16:31.890 --> 16:34.390
It may be a talisman, but something like that three times in a row?

16:34.390 --> 16:35.480
You'll die!

16:35.890 --> 16:36.860
But...

16:36.860 --> 16:37.950
Don't be reckless.

16:38.990 --> 16:41.330
That's right, Tamaki.

16:41.700 --> 16:44.390
In any case, it looks like everyone is safe.

16:44.830 --> 16:45.890
Yes.

16:49.540 --> 16:51.640
They can no longer fight.

16:51.640 --> 16:53.840
Leave at once, Aria.

16:53.840 --> 16:54.970
Leave?

16:55.310 --> 16:57.640
You say some strange things, woman.

17:04.720 --> 17:05.620
Move!

17:16.700 --> 17:18.790
No!

17:40.820 --> 17:42.880
Did you think an attack like that...

17:44.390 --> 17:47.380
would defeat my servants?

17:50.530 --> 17:51.900
That's...

17:51.900 --> 17:53.330
I'll ask again.

17:54.100 --> 17:56.330
Give me the Artifact, Sibyl.

17:57.040 --> 17:58.560
Why, Aria?

17:59.510 --> 18:01.570
I don't understand.

18:02.210 --> 18:05.110
Why are you doing this?

18:05.710 --> 18:07.870
Because that is what is written in the Kokusho.

18:08.750 --> 18:09.770
Kokusho?

18:10.920 --> 18:13.410
I have my purpose.

18:14.050 --> 18:17.320
I am the holy woman, the gods' messenger.

18:18.060 --> 18:19.860
I obey the word of the gods,

18:19.860 --> 18:23.800
to release the power sleeping in the earth and make it mine.

18:24.300 --> 18:28.260
I must dispose of those who bar my path.

18:28.470 --> 18:29.900
That's all.

18:30.400 --> 18:32.710
That isn't right!

18:32.710 --> 18:35.880
How do you know you're right?!

18:35.880 --> 18:36.780
What will you do?

18:37.740 --> 18:40.180
Hand over the Artifact peacefully or...

18:40.180 --> 18:41.410
Don't do it.

18:51.490 --> 18:52.620
I understand.

18:53.260 --> 18:54.960
I'll give you this Artifact.

18:55.600 --> 18:57.030
However,

18:57.030 --> 18:59.470
I have no intention of abandoning my role.

19:00.270 --> 19:01.790
When we meet again,

19:03.300 --> 19:04.570
I will not lose.

19:06.070 --> 19:08.070
When we meet again?

19:08.880 --> 19:12.010
Very well. I agree to your proposal.

19:12.010 --> 19:13.950
Lady Aria, that's...

19:13.950 --> 19:16.680
If they impede us again, we'll dispose of them.

19:16.680 --> 19:19.550
But it's different now. That's all.

19:22.320 --> 19:25.320
Farewell, descendant of Sibyl.

19:27.660 --> 19:28.650
Stop!

19:32.530 --> 19:34.930
What are you doing, Drei?

19:35.770 --> 19:39.510
I thought it would be best to prevent future distress.

19:39.510 --> 19:41.410
Did I allow that?

19:42.180 --> 19:43.140
Stand down.

19:44.010 --> 19:45.250
I apologize.

19:45.250 --> 19:47.310
My servant was out of line.

20:15.310 --> 20:17.180
I shall withdraw from here.

20:17.180 --> 20:20.110
However, next time I will come without mercy as an enemy.

20:32.430 --> 20:35.520
I see. The second seal, as well.

20:36.200 --> 20:37.730
Yes.

20:37.730 --> 20:41.570
If she doesn't awaken in time,

20:41.570 --> 20:43.130
that leaves no choice.

20:44.240 --> 20:45.770
Yes.

20:45.770 --> 20:47.740
Mitsuru, you mustn't.

20:48.840 --> 20:51.000
You mustn't be sentimental.

20:51.750 --> 20:59.080
You and I must be cogs who live only so the world may indulge in peace.

20:59.790 --> 21:00.780
Yes.

21:05.730 --> 21:07.390
Things are gloomy.

21:23.980 --> 21:26.610
I suppose it's time to make my move.

21:27.450 --> 21:31.450
From between the trees

21:31.450 --> 21:39.360
The evening sun spills onto this tree lined street

21:39.360 --> 21:44.870
Talking and laughing

21:44.870 --> 21:50.270
Mysteriously made me feel at ease

21:52.770 --> 21:59.110
Since the two of us met that day

21:59.110 --> 22:02.980
Through the time we have spent together

22:02.980 --> 22:12.980
This feeling has grown

22:16.460 --> 22:19.170
In order to protect you

22:19.170 --> 22:24.770
I am here right now

22:24.770 --> 22:30.640
You try to act strong

22:30.640 --> 22:35.380
But I will accept all your weaknesses

22:35.380 --> 22:38.220
No matter how small

22:38.220 --> 22:43.660
You can rely on me for anything

22:43.660 --> 22:50.960
If you trip I will catch you with these hands

22:59.210 --> 23:02.440
Takuma, Mahiro,

23:02.440 --> 23:05.610
Yuichi, Shinji,

23:05.610 --> 23:06.810
Suguru...

23:09.480 --> 23:10.850
I'm sorry!

23:13.220 --> 23:15.750
I'm sorry things turned out like this. Really...

23:24.930 --> 23:28.370
As long as you're all right...

23:28.870 --> 23:30.270
I'm sorry!

23:35.440 --> 23:38.070
What's with that face?

23:39.750 --> 23:43.110
You want it again?

23:47.420 --> 23:50.120
Then come back here.

23:52.560 --> 23:55.390
I'll do it as many times as you like.

23:56.200 --> 24:00.960
Next Time: The Breaking of Bonds
